OL,3,GSouth West                             
OL,5,CToday:FAn increasingly wet and rather  
OL,6,Fwindy morning is on the cards with     
OL,7,Fsome heavy bursts of rain developing.  
OL,8,FDuring the afternoon the rain will     
OL,9,Fslowly clear eastwards allowing skies  
OL,10,Fto brighten a little from the west.    
OL,11,FWinds will also ease.                  
OL,13,CTonight:FAny lingering rain will soon  
OL,14,Fclear in the east this evening,        
OL,15,Fleaving a mostly dry night with clear  
OL,16,Fperiods. Perhaps a few showers         
OL,17,Fdeveloping near to western coasts      
OL,18,Flater.                                 
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
