OL,3,GSouth West                             
OL,5,CSunday:FOn the whole Sunday promises   
OL,6,Fto be a brighter day than Saturday,    
OL,7,Falthough a scattering of showers are   
OL,8,Flikely to feed across the region in    
OL,9,Fthe southwesterly breeze.              
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMonday
OL,12,Fand Tuesday look mild, cloudy and      
OL,13,Fwindy with outbreaks of rain,          
OL,14,Fespecially in the west. The rain       
OL,15,Fshould clear to leave a sunnier day on 
OL,16,FWednesday, with some showers.          
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
